":"そして、そっと息子の部屋の扉を開けて、中を覗く。すると、彼女が言っていた女性が、スヤスヤとベッドで寝ていた。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":9.304489795918368,"title":"シーン 643","slideTitle":"スライド #643","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.643.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.304489795918368,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E4877A39-91FD-4B41-8746-4DF3A27B1AD5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/寝顔３.pxd","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_644_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","telop":"そして、私と彼の部屋に入ると、紅夢がベッドの片方で寝ていた。私は、それを確認すると、リビングで待つ彼女の元に戻る。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":10.769478458049887,"title":"シーン 644","slideTitle":"スライド #644","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.644.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.769478458049887,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E2645B09-1AE8-4045-921C-D5B515E392EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手困り顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_645_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「それで、各部屋の様子はどうでしたか？」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":2.560907029478458,"title":"シーン 645","slideTitle":"スライド #645","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.645.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.560907029478458,"seVolume":1},{"id":"EA07E2F2-D744-41B7-AA04-47AFB78EAC54","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手困り顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_646_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「あなたに指摘された通りです。それで…本当に私の息子の許嫁に妹さんをもらって大丈夫でしょうか？」","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":8.745238095238095,"title":"シーン 646","slideTitle":"スライド #646","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.646.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.745238095238095,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1E97E673-A385-4CDE-8EB4-9A9DF2E2DC1C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_647_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「ええ、妹がきっとそれを望みますから…。」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":2.6713151927437644,"title":"シーン 647","slideTitle":"スライド #647","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.647.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.6713151927437644,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C5E546C4-411F-49FB-B845-38C1268F4AB8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_648_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「建設会社の方は、後継者はいるのですか？」","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.714489795918367,"title":"シーン 648","slideTitle":"スライド #648","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.648.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.714489795918367,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D62C04B8-C543-4299-AB6A-77B154657285","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手困り顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_649_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「後継者は今は、いませんが…、それが何か？」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.0629931972789115,"title":"シーン 649","slideTitle":"スライド #649","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.649.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.0629931972789115,"seVolume":1},{"id":"92F60068-FEAF-4D47-AE35-F0D6CC5008B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手困り顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_650_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"私は、息子の事情を話すべきか迷う、だが、ここで話しておかないと後々大変になるのは目に見えていた。「実は…」","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":9.547732426303854,"title":"シーン 650","slideTitle":"スライド #650","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.650.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.547732426303854,"seVolume":1},{"id":"B72C80F2-7E53-438C-A9C2-52223957F18C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手驚く.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_651_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"私は、彼女の話にとても驚く。","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":2.556734693877551,"title":"シーン 651","slideTitle":"スライド #651","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.651.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.556734693877551,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1BC9DB34-769C-4FB5-BA8B-97E7CBC7A07F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア（弱る）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_652_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「そうですか…」私は、このままでは養子を迎え入れるか、企業合併以外の選択肢しか残されない事実に考え込む。","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":7.556734693877551,"title":"シーン 652","slideTitle":"スライド #652","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.652.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.556734693877551,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1DFD95BE-E0F4-4D0A-9CC9-EF9AC91CF3DF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_653_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「承知しました…。それでもう一つお願いがあるのですか…」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.615079365079365,"title":"シーン 653","slideTitle":"スライド #653","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.653.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.615079365079365,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F5D39567-5306-4498-841A-74BC0B9986BA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_654_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"私はその内容に驚く。そして考えこむ。それから数分程度の間の後、告げる。「それでは、息子の今後については頼みます。」","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":11.094489795918367,"title":"シーン 654","slideTitle":"スライド #654","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.654.jpeg","voiceDuration":11.094489795918367,"seVolume":1},{"id":"4C226C6E-AC71-4F4C-9EA4-FB494F490D98","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_655_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「私からの二つの願いに答えていただき、ありがとうございます。このご恩は、近いうちに必ずお返しします。」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":7.190068027210884,"title":"シーン 655","slideTitle":"スライド #655","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.655.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.190068027210884,"seVolume":1},{"id":"43DF5E5A-F15F-41D8-9262-01D2ACCADB04","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_656_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"彼女はそういうと、家を去っていった。私は、「はぁ…」吐息を吐くと、そのまま入浴を済ませて、寝室に向かう。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":9.123242630385487,"title":"シーン 656","slideTitle":"スライド #656","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.656.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.123242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6F92EA54-35D6-4E2D-ACA0-967538EB4321","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/寝顔３.pxd","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_657_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","telop":"そして、部屋にそっと入って気づく。「今日は久々の添い寝ね…」私はそう呟きながら、彼の横に入り、寝付くのだった。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":9.803242630385487,"title":"シーン 657","slideTitle":"スライド #657","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.657.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.803242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7FAC1784-9162-4483-8CEB-658ACEFAD10B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_658_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「ねぇ、私と一緒に、大人の体験、してみない？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":4.341995464852608,"title":"シーン 658","slideTitle":"スライド #658","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.658.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.341995464852608,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1E84D814-090C-470F-9F2E-6BB904C1BD14","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_659_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「大人の体験？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":1.2147619047619047,"title":"シーン 659","slideTitle":"スライド #659","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.659.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.2147619047619047,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3B6E8D8D-18BE-464B-BF4D-820D7E0A6B41","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_660_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「うん、そう、私が導いてあげる、だから私に身を委ねて。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":5.159478458049887,"title":"シーン 660","slideTitle":"スライド #660","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.660.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.159478458049887,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7BB4B9CE-BEDB-4A2B-8E89-6550DC3AFCF5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_661_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、息を吐きながら、脱力する。\nすると、彼女が僕の背中に手を回し、唇をそっとくっつける。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.814761904761905,"title":"シーン 661","slideTitle":"スライド #661","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.661.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.814761904761905,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E596832C-F077-4384-AEF2-B761C577AEA1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_662_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"すると、彼女が僕の手を握り、そっと彼女の胸に当てる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.008253968253968,"title":"シーン 662","slideTitle":"スライド #662","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.662.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.008253968253968,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/自主規制ピー音.mp3","id":"B1F3A482-FA54-4F79-8F0E-0E31918315F4","seStartTimeOffset":0.24,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_663_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「ほら、どう先生のーは？大きい？小さい？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":4.174489795918367,"title":"シーン 663","slideTitle":"スライド #663","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: 自主規制ピー音","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.663.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.174489795918367,"seVolume":1},{"id":"60D4146A-B039-4330-B9CE-4F0881115327","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_664_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「…僕は、どっちでも大丈夫ですよ…」僕は、どこかふわふわしたような、だが確かに感じるその感触を味わう。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.469115646258503,"title":"シーン 664","slideTitle":"スライド #664","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.664.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.469115646258503,"seVolume":1},{"id":"0B5D8F84-3D2D-4A95-A8C6-E0FA176CF604","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_665_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"私は、彼に自らの胸を触らせた後、そっと彼の頭を胸に埋める。\n「ほら、もっと力を抜いて…、リラーックス、リラーックス。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":10.384489795918368,"title":"シーン 665","slideTitle":"スライド #665","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.665.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.384489795918368,"seVolume":1},{"id":"881902CB-6332-413A-A636-E9660A5A80A8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/夜のお誘い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_666_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"彼女はそう言いながら、僕の服をそっと掴む。僕は、それに気づかずに、ふわふわしながら感じる感触に身を任せるのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.60063492063492,"title":"シーン 666","slideTitle":"スライド #666","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.666.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.60063492063492,"seVolume":1},{"id":"891BA6C6-643D-488D-983D-4FB246F83BDD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","animationDuration":1.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"表示時間:1.5秒","telop":"一方、霊夢は…","duration":1.5,"title":"シーン 667: 一方、霊夢は…","slideTitle":"スライド #667","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volum