_藤原妹紅.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","telop":"息子がいなくなって魔理沙がやってきてから、2週間ちょっと、その間に、この三角関係になり、私に危機が訪れていた。","voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","duration":8.067278911564626,"title":"シーン 912","slideTitle":"スライド #912","characterName":"藤原妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_DF97","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.912.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.067278911564626,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1DE980A5-F3F1-413A-9796-D2D210CE6096","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/霊夢（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_913_藤原妹紅.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","telop":"妻を選べば、ビームが飛んできて、魔理沙を選べば、妻の怒声が響いてしまうこの状況に私は、ただ無言になるしか出来なかった。","voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","duration":8.223537414965987,"title":"シーン 913","slideTitle":"スライド #913","characterName":"藤原妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_DF97","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.913.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.223537414965987,"seVolume":1},{"id":"171E25CE-61F2-4DED-A04B-2F6CC9C1F369","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/霊夢（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_914_藤原妹紅.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","telop":"お願いだから、早く戻ってきてくれ、息子よ…。私は叶いもしないはずのそんな願いを抱きながら、この状況をやり過ごした。","voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","duration":8.091247165532879,"title":"シーン 914","slideTitle":"スライド #914","characterName":"藤原妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_DF97","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.914.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.091247165532879,"seVolume":1},{"id":"9523EFDD-EABB-4007-9442-594A7D2AEE83","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_915_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"体力テストと、統一模試を受けてから数日が経ち、遠足まであと1週間を切った今日、僕は教室に入ると、自分の席に着く。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.947369614512471,"title":"シーン 915","slideTitle":"スライド #915","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.915.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.947369614512471,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7217BED7-BFE5-4225-AD1C-8A8A64BF4EC4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_916_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"すると、さとりがこちらに駆け寄ってくる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":2.564761904761905,"title":"シーン 916","slideTitle":"スライド #916","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.916.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.564761904761905,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D66BD356-DFB2-4511-8CFF-341CBB98F116","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_917_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「紅夢さん、あなた学内で、有名人になってますよ。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":3.0151927437641723,"title":"シーン 917","slideTitle":"スライド #917","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.917.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.0151927437641723,"seVolume":1},{"id":"64345661-672D-4D02-A20D-F8DF3A4B13D1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_918_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「えっ…」僕はそう呟き、なぜ自分が有名人になったかを考える。そして、彼女に聞く。「なぜですか…？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.756077097505669,"title":"シーン 918","slideTitle":"スライド #918","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.918.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.756077097505669,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C7D1611B-99A2-4378-B70D-F53C9957DFA8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_919_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「本来なら大学受験に使われるような高難度の問題が入り混じった模試で満点を取り、文武両道な転校生が学内にいると…」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.750884353741497,"title":"シーン 919","slideTitle":"スライド #919","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.919.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.750884353741497,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BF18F450-0C7A-4BAE-8A1B-F93DBA1A0DE5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_920_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「教員側も驚愕しているっていう噂と共に、生徒の間でも話題になってますよ。それこそ遠足と学校行事よりも…」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.397596371882086,"title":"シーン 920","slideTitle":"スライド #920","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.920.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.397596371882086,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1D35F247-5F92-4B2F-B0CC-1BEA9B251E0C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_921_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「私が聞いた限りだと、あなたは1500mを数分で走り切った後に受けた模試で100点が出た、転校生だと言われてますよ。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.882698412698413,"title":"シーン 921","slideTitle":"スライド #921","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.921.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.882698412698413,"seVolume":1},{"id":"09E890F1-4626-4362-AEB2-38B213658CDF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_922_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「女子は、噂に敏感で、何でもかんでもすぐに広まるので、気をつけないと、後々面倒ごとに巻き込まれちゃいますよ。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.2791836734693875,"title":"シーン 922","slideTitle":"スライド #922","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.922.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.2791836734693875,"seVolume":1},{"id":"9FC5F721-5024-42C1-9AFD-08762E154CAF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_923_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「えっと…」\n僕は、彼女から聞いたその内容に困惑するのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.466938775510204,"title":"シーン 923","slideTitle":"スライド #923","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.923.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.466938775510204,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/教室の戸を開ける.mp3","id":"AC44F391-4047-4CF5-82DA-CCA2622666F5","seStartTimeOffset":1.23,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_924_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"それから、さとりは自席に戻り、しばらくすると、教室の扉がチャイムと同時に開く。そして、担任が入ってくる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.25390022675737,"title":"シーン 924","slideTitle":"スライド #924","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: 教室の戸を開ける","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.924.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.25390022675737,"seVolume":0.85},{"id":"E79279F1-C469-45C2-831B-9C7BC5E42772","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/早苗（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_925_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"僕はいつものように、素早く立ち上がり、クラスメイトと同じタイミングで礼と挨拶をすると、彼女の合図で座る。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.321292517006802,"title":"シーン 925","slideTitle":"スライド #925","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.925.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.321292517006802,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7FFB1757-CD67-43DA-B856-8C5DBB695D44","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/早苗（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_926_東風谷早苗.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「それでは、朝礼を始めます。今日は、テスト返却の後は、遠足に向けた、全校集会なので昼食後速やかに移動するように。」","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","duration":9.00156462585034,"title":"シーン 926","slideTitle":"スライド #926","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_D32F","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.926.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.00156462585034,"seVolume":1},{"id":"2BF19DDE-6F8C-4AE8-9784-3DE60A468496","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/早苗（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_927_東風谷早苗.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「それと藤原さんは、今学園内で流れている情報の真意を確かめるので、朝礼後、速やかに職員室を訪ねるように。」","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","duration":7.785351473922902,"title":"シーン 927","slideTitle":"スライド #927","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_D32F","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.927.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.785351473922902,"seVolume":1},{"id":"33873639-492B-4406-AA93-06231D98C34E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/早苗（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_928_東風谷早苗.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「今日の連絡は以上です。今日も1日、勉学を励みましょう。」","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","duration":4.300090702947846,"title":"シーン 928","slideTitle":"スライド #928","characterName":"東風谷早苗","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_D32F","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.928.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.300090702947846,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7345BC37-E176-4160-9389-903BF59669EF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_929_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"彼女はそういうと、去っていた。\n僕は、きょとんとしながら、ふと我に帰り、職員室に向かう。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.699546485260771,"title":"シーン 929","slideTitle":"スライド #929","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.929.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.699546485260771,"seVolume":1},{"id":"ED6FB05A-74B2-458A-BDBA-04D2FE44FC8D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_930_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"そして、僕が職員室に来ると、ある女性がやってくる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.7756462585034014,"title":"シーン 930","slideTitle":"スライド #930","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.930.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.7756462585034014,"seVolume":1},{"id":"8FBB68D9-D354-4191-A151-B04C6F0A4EFA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_931_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「藤原さん、早速ですが、別室に移動して、あなたの話を聞かせてもらうので、私の後についてきてください。」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":6.727891156462585,"title":"シーン 931","slideTitle":"スライド #931","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.931.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.727891156462585,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6F35C8BF-015F-4C9B-8752-44A4D0462849","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_932_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"僕がそう言われ、やってきたのは被服室だった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.0267346938775512,"title":"シーン 932","slideTitle":"スライド #932","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\