,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.942.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.5495464852607705,"seVolume":1},{"id":"9A018575-E70A-4FBA-A152-F8047D99CEAA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_943_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「ええ、あなたの心身にかかる事柄ですから、\nぜひ、聞かせてください。」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":4.160680272108843,"title":"シーン 943","slideTitle":"スライド #943","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.943.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.160680272108843,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BBB2BBB6-5402-4A85-ACA8-262F8501D0EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_944_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"僕は、彼女の意思を確認すると、過去を思い返しながら話す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.356077097505669,"title":"シーン 944","slideTitle":"スライド #944","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.944.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.356077097505669,"seVolume":1},{"id":"AE20211D-8F1C-4D0F-89BC-AE81468A3374","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_945_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「それで、あなたはこの学校に転校して、良かったですか？」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":3.3903854875283446,"title":"シーン 945","slideTitle":"スライド #945","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.945.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.3903854875283446,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A22F59AB-86DB-45CA-ABFF-AFA47413A63F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_946_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「ええ、前の学校と比べると、かなり良いです。母に、母の母校に転校したいと言って、良かったと僕は思っています。」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.435419501133786,"title":"シーン 946","slideTitle":"スライド #946","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.946.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.435419501133786,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BA2B852E-1FA6-4A55-BE86-A12D75E6A5BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_947_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「そうですか…、ところで話の節々から、あなたの記憶には、欠けているところがありますが、何か心当たりはありますか？」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":6.837482993197279,"title":"シーン 947","slideTitle":"スライド #947","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.947.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.837482993197279,"seVolume":1},{"id":"4FFD6226-E80E-4A39-BEE9-C56ECE3CBF21","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_948_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「…正直に言って分からないです。小さかった頃は、それこそ些細な違いで、記憶が欠け始めたのは、中学からですから…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.410430839002268,"title":"シーン 948","slideTitle":"スライド #948","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.948.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.410430839002268,"seVolume":1},{"id":"4E7FA1A3-48BC-46AD-B8F3-485B1CABA25B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_949_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「…ただ、証拠を出せというのなら、僕のこの身体が、それを示してます…、正直にいうと人様には見せたくないですが…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.962607709750567,"title":"シーン 949","slideTitle":"スライド #949","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.949.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.962607709750567,"seVolume":1},{"id":"AF70D1DE-DD30-45DB-92D9-0FBDEDB94864","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_950_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「そうですか…。ところで、あなたは、この間の模試を受けている時の様子と、午後の1500m走の様子を見たいですか？」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":7.084580498866213,"title":"シーン 950","slideTitle":"スライド #950","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.950.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.084580498866213,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D3E26C4E-4BAF-49EE-9EC5-0F8979696D68","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_951_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「えっ？」僕は、彼女の急な質問に、そう返してしまう。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.421292517006803,"title":"シーン 951","slideTitle":"スライド #951","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.951.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.421292517006803,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1286E0D7-067E-4B8A-A54D-70CF05344CA0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_952_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「もし、見たいのなら、教員用のPCにデータが保存されているので、お見せできますが…、どうしますか？」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":5.884897959183673,"title":"シーン 952","slideTitle":"スライド #952","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.952.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.884897959183673,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E71D30D0-27E5-484E-9307-5A3EE9242A2C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_953_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「えっと…」僕はふと迷う。確かに、こないだの気を失っている間に、自分が何をしてかを見たいが、見たくない気持ちもある。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.561519274376417,"title":"シーン 953","slideTitle":"スライド #953","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.953.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.561519274376417,"seVolume":1},{"id":"CBC43BD0-C637-49D2-A627-EBAB5E668B46","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_954_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「いや、いいです…」僕は、それから彼女にそう返す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.7039002267573697,"title":"シーン 954","slideTitle":"スライド #954","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.954.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.7039002267573697,"seVolume":1},{"id":"486AD036-E39B-4623-ACE4-D7094CF99A1E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/咲夜（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_955_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"「そうですか…、最後に一つだけ、こないだ渡した例の遠足に関する条件ですが、無事に満たしましたよ、では失礼。」","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":6.8395918367346935,"title":"シーン 955","slideTitle":"スライド #955","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.955.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.8395918367346935,"seVolume":1},{"id":"789DEF19-D065-4A0D-AEF9-FD01FA1EFACF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_956_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"彼女はそういうと、部屋をさっていった。僕は、ゆっくりと立ちあがろうとすると、突如として頭痛が走り、床に崩れ落ちる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.461519274376418,"title":"シーン 956","slideTitle":"スライド #956","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.956.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.461519274376418,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A2331F57-385A-4676-80C2-3DD53101E4BE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_957_十六夜咲夜.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","telop":"そして、僕の様子を見に戻ってきた彼女を、\n一瞬見ると、そのまま気を失うのだった。","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","duration":5.049297052154195,"title":"シーン 957","slideTitle":"スライド #957","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.957.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.049297052154195,"seVolume":1},{"id":"03A0D09A-49C4-4C39-B313-C36BB47D79FF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","animationDuration":1.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","telop":"彼がふと気がつくと…","duration":1.5,"title":"シーン 958: 彼がふと気がつくと…","slideTitle":"スライド #958","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.958.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"FED0E645-E518-4D87-ABFC-8EE9042786E6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_959_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791193839_80109.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791193839_80109.png","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、そこはトイレだった。\nそして、手を洗ってから、トイレを出る。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":5.811519274376417,"title":"シーン 959","slideTitle":"スライド #959","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.959.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.811519274376417,"seVolume":1},{"id":"FEC66E06-ECC9-4CFE-B5C4-138770ED8944","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_960_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc485831_学校の廊下（日中）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc485831_学校の廊下（日中）.jpg","telop":"そして、学校の廊下を歩いているときに、ふと午後は、全校集会だったことを思い出す。そして、僕は体育館に向かう。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.458253968253969,"title":"シーン 960","slideTitle":"スライド #960","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.960.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.458253968253969,"seVolume":1},{"id":"80982BB8-7696-4926-BA1C-E4C7063D1795","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_961_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","telop":"僕が体育館に来ると、すでにほとんどの生徒や児童が集まっているようだった。僕は、ふと周りを見渡し、ある列に入る。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.357165532879819,"title":"シーン 961","slideTitle":"スライド #961","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.961.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.357165532879819,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D70999FC-1A67-4C50-9BB7-2B8A131BAA68","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_962_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","telop":"それから、数時間の間、遠足の説明を聞くのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.9658503401360545,"title":"シーン 962","slideTitle":"スライド #962","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.962.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.9658503401360545,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C7B611A0-237F-486C-BF98-459FAF2E4F16","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","animationDuration":1.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","telop":"説明会が終わり…","duration":1.5,"title":"シーン 963: 説明会が終わり…","slideTitle":"スライド #963","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.963.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"A3C6A3E4-8EB9-4F05-A579-A07C28CED8F0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/早苗（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_964_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"僕は、朝と同じように礼と挨拶をして、数分程度の短い週例を終えると、そのまま、学校の校門に向かう。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.766938775510204,"title":"シーン 964","slideTitle":"スライド #964","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.964.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.766938775510204,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F7257442-4DC7-454F-9F19-4270B502FFD0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_965_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"僕が、学校の校門に来ると、ある車が門の前に止まっていた。\nすると、中からフランが降りてくる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.132154195011338,"title":"シーン 965","slideTitle":"スライド #965","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.965.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.132154195011338,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D49B769A-5B85-4571-AA08-B00FE74DCD02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_966_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","telop":"「学校、お疲れ様、紅夢。とりあえず、車に乗って。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":5.198231292517007,"title":"シーン 966","slideTitle":"スライド #966","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.966.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.198231292517007,"seVolume":1},{"id":"ECFDF5C3-D6F4-411E-B937-8EED234DB419","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_967_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、車に乗ると、数十分で高速に入る。\n「あの、フランさん、どこに行くのですか？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":8.954489795918366,"title":"シーン 967","slideTitle":"スライド #967","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.967.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.954489795918366,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6F5446F5-0974-4CA6-8EDE-F2AE435EB20B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_968_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","telop":"「それは、向こうに着くまで秘密。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":2.6419954648526076,"title":"シーン 968","slideTitle":"スライド #968","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.968.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.6419954648526076,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3CE4563A-D4C2-42C2-BCE6-C822452AB612","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_969_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","telop":"僕は彼女にそう返され、前に向き直る。それから、僕はフランの隣の助手席で、ただぼーっと車窓を眺めるのだった。","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":9.563242630385487,"title":"シーン 969","slideTitle":"スライド #969","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.969.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.563242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F6E6E0BE-9DF8-4CE5-8CC4-8DE500388E3E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_970_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image53.jpeg","telop":"僕は、フランに連れられて、とある山間のキャンプ場に来ていた。そして、僕は、彼女にキャンプ用品を持ってきたかを聞く。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.25172335600907,"title":"シーン 970","slideTitle":"スライド #970","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.970.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.25172335600907,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F401E4B3-8FF1-415D-9B49-6A11BAA7A6D4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_971_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image53.jpeg","telop":"「もちろん、持ってきたよ。」私はそう言い、車からテントなどのキャンプ用品を取り出し、テントの設営をする。","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":8.641995464852608,"title":"シーン 971","slideTitle":"スライド #971","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.971.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.641995464852608,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D75962F5-BBE5-4D9E-A28B-CB039D7B1F50","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_972_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image53.jpeg","telop":"それから、数分から数十分の間、彼女は黙々と、テントの設営やキャンプの準備を進めていく。「何か手伝いますか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.421292517006803,"title":"シーン 972","slideTitle":"スライド #972","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.972.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.421292517006803,"seVolume":1},{"id":"9DC33B1B-D6B8-49EC-A200-1AD24AFDD0A7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_973_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image53.jpeg","telop":"「いや、手伝わなくていいよ。そこらへんで座って、待ってて。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":5.033242630385487,"title":"シーン 973","slideTitle":"スライド #973","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.973.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.033242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D7429273-8644-41D1-B0F9-96BF3A2FDE1B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_974_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image53.jpeg","telop":"僕は、彼女がそう返すと、彼女の作業の邪魔にならない位置で、座って、その作業が終わるまで、周囲を見渡すのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.260430839002268,"title":"シーン 974","slideTitle":"スライド #974","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.974.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.260430839002268,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3CE09FDB-30E7-4BB0-8918-FB8FD6F5A78F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_975_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image55.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image55.jpeg","telop":"テントの設営が終わり、夕日が静まると、フランはあらかじめ準備されていた食材とフライパンを焚き火の上に置く。","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.750884353741497,"title":"シーン 975","slideTitle":"スライド #975","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.975.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.750884353741497,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7B229E19-7699-4423-9FB3-812E61418F5B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extract