/フラン（狂気）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1023_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image56.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image56.jpeg","telop":"「見ーつけた。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":1.0844897959183672,"title":"シーン 1023","slideTitle":"スライド #1023","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1023.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.0844897959183672,"seVolume":1},{"id":"0316E3C2-D553-4F4A-8297-E061A5D7F4EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1024_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image56.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image56.jpeg","telop":"僕は、彼女の気配から、直感的に、次の行動を予測する。\nそして、彼女とは反対方向に、回転し、立ち上がる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":9.173469387755102,"title":"シーン 1024","slideTitle":"スライド #1024","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1024.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.173469387755102,"seVolume":1},{"id":"5FE406CE-975B-4514-8D22-6E5FD6B7D7F7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1025_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image56.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image56.jpeg","telop":"そして、彼女がこちらに襲いかかるタイミングで、背後に回り、\n腕に力を込めると、それを彼女の首筋に当てる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.651723356009071,"title":"シーン 1025","slideTitle":"スライド #1025","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1025.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.651723356009071,"seVolume":1},{"id":"55E2C3E8-BD37-4DF5-92E0-E7A28A20F1A7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/ぐったり.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1026_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image56.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image56.jpeg","telop":"すると、彼女は何かを言いながら、その場に倒れ込む。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.577823129251701,"title":"シーン 1026","slideTitle":"スライド #1026","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1026.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.577823129251701,"seVolume":1},{"id":"52097CA3-561E-4BC1-A06B-AB2F5FDAB7EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1027_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image56.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image56.jpeg","telop":"そして、僕は、今何をしたのかを理解すると共に、再び頭痛に晒されて、彼女に被さるように倒れ込むのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.95281179138322,"title":"シーン 1027","slideTitle":"スライド #1027","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1027.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.95281179138322,"seVolume":1},{"id":"43BE62E9-CDAC-4874-B3F2-BFAD8761F8F3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/影あり驚き後ろ手.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1028_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","telop":"私は、フランに電話をしたあと、ずっとそわそわしていた。そして、ふと時計を見ると、時刻は真夜中を指していた。","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":7.487981859410431,"title":"シーン 1028","slideTitle":"スライド #1028","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1028.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.487981859410431,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E5ABD91A-2446-4490-A099-935C6EA0ACF0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/Toho