 #1255","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1255.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.5932653061224489,"seVolume":1},{"id":"093A7952-A52C-427E-B4B6-FBB839626913","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1256_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「あんたたち一体、遠足で何をしてるの？」","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","duration":2.383469387755102,"title":"シーン 1256","slideTitle":"スライド #1256","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1B13","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1256.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.383469387755102,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F33D1E76-905A-4FB8-A410-870EF3BECF2D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1257_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「えっ？」","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":0.5,"title":"シーン 1257","slideTitle":"スライド #1257","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1257.jpeg","voiceDuration":0.5,"seVolume":1},{"id":"79F87665-8766-4B1C-8415-D436CF73F78C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1258_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"僕は、彼女が困惑しているのを見て、目線で電話口を変わったほうがいいか、確認する。すると、彼女はポケベルを僕に渡す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.936507936507937,"title":"シーン 1258","slideTitle":"スライド #1258","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1258.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.936507936507937,"seVolume":1},{"id":"B7CA5F98-6342-44AC-8D67-F9A779D0EDDF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1259_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「もしもし、紅夢です…、どうしましたか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":2.806077097505669,"title":"シーン 1259","slideTitle":"スライド #1259","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1259.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.806077097505669,"seVolume":1},{"id":"69FAAB08-CAAD-4EF8-83E4-64549968BFEC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1260_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「美鈴から聞いたわよ、あんたが居候している家に送ったデビットカードから、短時間で5件の入出金があったみたいじゃない。」","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","duration":6.531519274376417,"title":"シーン 1260","slideTitle":"スライド #1260","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1B13","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1260.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.531519274376417,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A229A03E-FFA5-4682-A518-6A4F1F2F4C7C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1261_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「それで、あんたたちは、これからどうするのよ？」","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","duration":2.531609977324263,"title":"シーン 1261","slideTitle":"スライド #1261","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1B13","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1261.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.531609977324263,"seVolume":1},{"id":"10C08DB2-30C4-4058-97A2-A8B9906B3067","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1262_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","telop":"「あれ…パチュリーさんは、知らないんですか…、例のデビットカードが送られたとき、一緒に手紙が入っていたことを…？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.162607709750567,"title":"シーン 1262","slideTitle":"スライド #1262","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1262.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.162607709750567,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BF8F37F8-88D1-4B44-9ACE-EAA55EDBB0CF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/Ge