note_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1349_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"「あの…、もしこいしさんと紅夢さんが同じ部屋になるのなら、私との約束は、どうなるのかしら…。」私は、そう彼に聞く。","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":6.72047619047619,"title":"シーン 1349","slideTitle":"スライド #1349","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1349.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.72047619047619,"seVolume":1},{"id":"213CE725-DA41-4025-956B-DAFB2F7FF4C3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/困った笑み小口笑い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1350_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"僕は、アリスのその指摘で思い出す。「確かにそうですね…」\n僕は、そう言いながら、考える。だが、くしゃみが再び出る。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.773469387755101,"title":"シーン 1350","slideTitle":"スライド #1350","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1350.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.773469387755101,"seVolume":1},{"id":"0C865871-0305-4ACF-B06A-21B310317342","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/困った笑み小口笑い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1351_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"「今日の昼食は、各自で準備でも構いませんか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.456077097505669,"title":"シーン 1351","slideTitle":"スライド #1351","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1351.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.456077097505669,"seVolume":1},{"id":"827DC614-DD42-426F-8A95-37AF19BC476F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/困った笑み小口笑い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1352_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"「それで、構いませんよ。とりあえず、紅夢さんの、風邪を治すのが、先ですし…、ただこいしの発言にも…答えてくれますか？」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":7.054580498866213,"title":"シーン 1352","slideTitle":"スライド #1352","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1352.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.054580498866213,"seVolume":1},{"id":"025E79E8-BF29-4189-B90B-A39228112250","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/困った笑み小口笑い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1353_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"「じゃあ、誰と寝るかは、夕食後に決めるとして、とりあえず今は、僕とこいしさん、さとりさんとアリスさんでいいですか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.756077097505669,"title":"シーン 1353","slideTitle":"スライド #1353","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1353.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.756077097505669,"seVolume":1},{"id":"94D5B811-BB6D-4DC8-B04F-6F6E576AFD20","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1354_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"「ええ、そうしましょうか…」","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":1.3111337868480726,"title":"シーン 1354","slideTitle":"スライド #1354","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1354.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.3111337868480726,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BFEBC51E-3B6B-4091-AA09-6AF62577D3B4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/困った笑み小口笑い.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1355_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","telop":"それから、僕とこいし、アリスとさとりに分かれて部屋に入って行き、各自昼食をとり、それからは、休憩の時間になった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.22891156462585,"title":"シーン 1355","slideTitle":"スライド #1355","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1355.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.22891156462585,"seVolume":1},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"僕とこいしが部屋に入ると、僕は、浴室に入り、湯船をため、\n浴室を出ると、こいしがもじもじとしていた。","title":"シーン 1356","slideTitle":"スライド #1356","voice2StartTimeOffset":4.6278231292517,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"duration":7.464331065759637,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1356.jpeg","voice2AudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1356_操夢_2.wav","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1356_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2Duration":2.8365079365079366,"id":"2EBE5BC2-5446-4DD4-94D8-7194942202AF","voiceDuration":4.6278231292517,"backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/こいし（困る）.png","backgroundImagePat