くる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.310430839002268,"title":"シーン 1464","slideTitle":"スライド #1464","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1464.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.310430839002268,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6660DB41-F0DD-4CDE-9948-F00119651EB6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1465_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"「ねぇ、あなたがあの男子校からの転校生って、本当なの？」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":5.295283446712018,"title":"シーン 1465","slideTitle":"スライド #1465","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1465.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.295283446712018,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3736B8B2-4925-4560-B1C6-41E8216F61B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1466_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"「ええ、そうですけど…、それが何か…？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":2.53,"title":"シーン 1466","slideTitle":"スライド #1466","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1466.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.53,"seVolume":1},{"id":"342E27B0-43F5-4785-B08F-B2A51280DFCB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1467_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"「なら、私の質問に答えなさい。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":3.255238095238095,"title":"シーン 1467","slideTitle":"スライド #1467","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1467.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.255238095238095,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1989BAFC-099D-4EC3-A62C-82D703E02781","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1468_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、僕に関することをいろいろ聞いてきた。両親のことや、前の学校、そして最後にフランとの関係について。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.547369614512471,"title":"シーン 1468","slideTitle":"スライド #1468","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1468.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.547369614512471,"seVolume":1},{"id":"4D8CF30C-045D-497E-B64F-36CED0363634","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1469_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"「あなたのことが、よく分かったわ。とりあえず、向こうに折り返しの電話を、かけなさい。聞きたいことがまだあるから。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":10.075668934240364,"title":"シーン 1469","slideTitle":"スライド #1469","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1469.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.075668934240364,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BAA6F407-FECC-48DC-B668-2CE04CA0BE7B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1470_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、受話器を取ると、フランたちの家電にかけてもらい、その後彼女が、フランたちに長電話をしていた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.247369614512472,"title":"シーン 1470","slideTitle":"スライド #1470","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1470.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.247369614512472,"seVolume":1},{"id":"505933A4-157C-4769-9780-5CAD912D9B99","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","animationDuration":1.5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","telop":"一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","duration":1.5,"title":"シーン 1471: 一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","slideTitle":"スライド #1471","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1471.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"77B29DFD-59AF-4786-8C43-E2103A668ACA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1472_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg","telop":"私は、暇つぶしにテレビを見ていると、ある速報が流れる。\n私は、その速報を見ると、妹の部屋に向かう。","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":6.328185941043084,"title":"シーン 1472","slideTitle":"スライド #1472","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1472.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.328185941043084,"seVolume":1},{"id":"051E0953-D76D-486E-91A2-996D1C0E9480","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.