果音\/ドアを開ける1.mp3","id":"817E5E80-C6AB-44F0-BA71-622C9F2872D0","seStartTimeOffset":4.88,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/生成された画像.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1709_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"そして入ってきたのは、暗い影と涙があるこいしだった。\n彼女は入ってくるや否や、ドアを急いで閉めて、鍵をかける。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.098458049886622,"title":"シーン 1709","slideTitle":"スライド #1709","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: ドアを開ける1","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1709.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.098458049886622,"seVolume":0.85},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/ドアをドンドン叩く.mp3","id":"457490AC-BEA6-441B-B42A-7C2C51F1CDA5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/生成された画像.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1710_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"すると、廊下の方からドンドンとドアを叩く音がする。\nそして、こいしは僕に抱きつき、泣きながら言葉を出す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.43,"title":"シーン 1710","slideTitle":"スライド #1710","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: ドアをドンドン叩く","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1710.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.43,"seVolume":0.85},{"id":"CEFD0B22-F189-4E4A-A195-073BAA31F7C4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1711_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"「お兄ちゃん…、助けて…、お姉ちゃんが…、お姉ちゃんが…。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":4.589501133786848,"title":"シーン 1711","slideTitle":"スライド #1711","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1711.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.589501133786848,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/ドアノブをひねる1.mp3","id":"FC0842C2-E524-4FC0-B2B3-A3381FCBF61A","seStartTimeOffset":7.75,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1712_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"彼女が小さくそう呟きがなら、ひたすら泣き、僕は事態を把握する。廊下の人物は、扉を叩く代わりにをこじ開けようとする。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.843038548752835,"title":"シーン 1712","slideTitle":"スライド #1712","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: ドアノブをひねる1","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1712.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.843038548752835,"seVolume":0.85},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","id":"25BE5951-9214-4161-837B-3AFAD523677A","seStartTimeOffset":1.47,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1713_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"僕は、ここはこいしの頭をそっと撫でて、少しだけ落ち着かせると、部屋の電話を取り、ロビーに電話をかける。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.147369614512471,"title":"シーン 1713","slideTitle":"スライド #1713","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: 衣擦れ1","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1713.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.147369614512471,"seVolume":0.85},{"id":"40B149F6-7153-477D-AB46-26981CABAB3E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1714_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image77.jpeg","telop":"それから、さらに時間が経ち、こいしがそのまま泣き疲れて、僕の腕の中で眠り出した頃には、廊下は静かになっていた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.193038548752835,"title":"シーン 1714","slideTitle":"スライド #1714","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1714.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.193038548752835,"seVo