,"slideTitle":"スライド #1741","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1741.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.416938775510204,"seVolume":1},{"id":"2039E0FC-7A79-4B12-81C5-E86925EA0CCF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1742_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「そう…、とりあえず、これからどうするの？\n旅行を続けるわけじゃないんでしょ？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":5.789478458049887,"title":"シーン 1742","slideTitle":"スライド #1742","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1742.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.789478458049887,"seVolume":1},{"id":"974ED7A6-6D42-4279-BAF0-58056AB452D7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1743_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「まだ…今後のことは決めてないです。\n何よりこいしさんは、連絡手段がないので…。」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":5.723469387755102,"title":"シーン 1743","slideTitle":"スライド #1743","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1743.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.723469387755102,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc458855_【東方アレンジ】応援スカーレット!.mp3","id":"386559FF-31BC-427E-90C8-7E8CB584BFB6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1744_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「そう…。」私がそう言っていると、私のポケベルがなる。\n「ちょっと、電話してくるから、待ってて。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":7.998231292517007,"title":"シーン 1744","slideTitle":"スライド #1744","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: nc458855_【東方アレンジ】応援スカーレット!","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1744.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.998231292517007,"seVolume":0.159765625},{"id":"605BD8E0-B345-4221-99AD-33BBFA461D48","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1745_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"フランはそう言うと、部屋を出て行った。\n「それで、アリスさんとこいしさんは何か希望はありますか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.138253968253968,"title":"シーン 1745","slideTitle":"スライド #1745","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1745.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.138253968253968,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3353A87E-92E2-4187-8953-8AD7079950DA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1746_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「私は、安全が一番だと思うけど…」","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":2.238843537414966,"title":"シーン 1746","slideTitle":"スライド #1746","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1746.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.238843537414966,"seVolume":1},{"id":"4AFB8512-E731-4425-BBC4-8FC28EDDF44C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1747_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cac