.jpeg","telop":"「そうですか…。とりあえず、彼女が戻るのを待ちますか…」\n僕たちは、不安を抱えながら、フランが戻るのを待った。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.72891156462585,"title":"シーン 1749","slideTitle":"スライド #1749","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1749.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.72891156462585,"seVolume":1},{"id":"71CC7E22-76F6-4274-9A0B-50D2D548C628","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/怒る.png","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"伊吹萃香（学園の体育科担当教員）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1750: 伊吹萃香（学園の体育科担当教員）","slideTitle":"スライド #1750","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.2576440177252585,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1750.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"2E99CE59-1B53-4E95-BC13-B4590E71C614","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1751_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"僕たちがそれから、数十分ほど待っていると、フランが部屋の扉を再び開き、戻ってきた。そして、あることを告げる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.425646258503402,"title":"シーン 1751","slideTitle":"スライド #1751","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1751.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.425646258503402,"seVolume":1},{"id":"655C4436-2C50-458B-A0DD-9D830FBA180F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1752_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「今、お姉様が、こいしさんの両親と協議して、一時的に私たちたちの家で、こいしさんを預かることにしたって連絡が来た。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":10.034489795918367,"title":"シーン 1752","slideTitle":"スライド #1752","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1752.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.034489795918367,"seVolume":1},{"id":"83867E33-C6FF-416F-8AF0-C597EFDCA501","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1753_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「それで、彼女の両親はなんと言ってましたか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.108253968253968,"title":"シーン 1753","slideTitle":"スライド #1753","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1753.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.108253968253968,"seVolume":1},{"id":"0A8AFC9C-0AD6-4A12-9D34-858CC93E2BEE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1754_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「今、地下底国グループで派閥争いが起きていて、とてもじゃないけど彼女を家に帰らせるわけにはいかないって。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":8.113242630385487,"title":"シーン 1754","slideTitle":"スライド #1754","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1754.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.113242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"96A1B21D-8457-4EE0-B5C4-03A44EFC3A5B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1755_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「それと、こないだの突如の発表は、一旦無効にして、状況が落ち着くまで、私やお姉様と協力するって言ってた。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":9.576984126984128,"title":"シーン 1755","slideTitle":"スライド #1755","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1755.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.576984126984128,"seVolume":1},{"id":"5D9FAF60-AEC1-4CFC-8104-B222AA584A7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1756_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「そうですか…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":0.8973696145124717,"title":"シーン 1756","slideTitle":"スライド #1756","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1756.jpeg","voiceDuration":0.8973696145124717,"seVolume":1},{"id":"168A0787-4058-4C5B-A8B1-2F2F274A3CC4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1757_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「とりあえず、空港に戻って、私たちの家に帰る、それでいい？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":5.240748299319728,"title":"シーン 1757","slideTitle":"スライド #1757","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1757.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.240748299319728,"seVolume":1},{"id":"8EA15F94-48EA-472B-AA9C-3C4021520096","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1758_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「あの私は…」","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":0.7994104308390023,"title":"シーン 1758","slideTitle":"スライド #1758","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1758.jpeg","voiceDuration":0.7994104308390023,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C77FB8E2-3C8A-4465-AA16-93D820E87ABA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1759_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「アリスさんは、自由行動で構いませんよ。ただ、もし、もう少し滞在するなら、少しばかし手続きが必要ですが…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.295215419501133,"title":"シーン 1759","slideTitle":"スライド #1759","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1759.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.295215419501133,"seVolume":1},{"id":"85945762-D4C0-4FF5-9162-2D41BD9BDEB4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1760_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「じゃあ、私も家に帰ろうかしら…」","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","duration":1.8822902494331066,"title":"シーン 1760","slideTitle":"スライド #1760","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1760.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.8822902494331066,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A0FB4417-02FE-41BD-B51D-5090CA381E73","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1761_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「こいしさんは、それで大丈夫ですか？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":2.4604308390022678,"title":"シーン 1761","slideTitle":"スライド #1761","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1761.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.4604308390022678,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F2F27AAC-83D8-4D77-BDBB-4BD18C87C0AB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1762_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"「それでいいよ…、もう一度危険な目には遭いたくないし…」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":4.183424036281179,"title":"シーン 1762","slideTitle":"スライド #1762","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1762.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.183424036281179,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F43B638B-3DB2-45B7-B5DB-DD2DFA051A9E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1763_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image78.jpeg","telop":"僕は、二人の意見を把握すると、そのままフランが先導する形で、フランたちの家に帰っていくのだった。","voiceCharacte