767","slideTitle":"スライド #1767","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1767.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.3494784580498864,"seVolume":1},{"id":"AC844EF0-4BEF-4620-8CCF-0A0F085B4BC3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア（困り）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1768_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","telop":"「まぁ、今更言ったって、過ぎたことは仕方ないし、今日はこれくらいにしておくわ。今は、彼女の身の安全が優先だからね。」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":8.195736961451248,"title":"シーン 1768","slideTitle":"スライド #1768","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1768.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.195736961451248,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3BF9A081-CF61-4E4A-B2BA-EE827D594603","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1769_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、困った様子を浮かべるこいしを向く。\nそして、そこで会話が途切れ、沈黙の時間が流れた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.488684807256236,"title":"シーン 1769","slideTitle":"スライド #1769","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1769.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.488684807256236,"seVolume":1},{"id":"EE3E2149-CCDD-44E6-91BA-B20462A36AF6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1770_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"僕たちは夕飯を食べ終えると、歯を磨き、\nこいしとともに元々フランと僕の二人部屋だった部屋に来た。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.767596371882086,"title":"シーン 1770","slideTitle":"スライド #1770","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1770.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.767596371882086,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A2E6D4E5-858D-48A3-8B7A-B0B4C4A7F16D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1771_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"「何だか…ごめんなさい…。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":2.255238095238095,"title":"シーン 1771","slideTitle":"スライド #1771","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1771.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.255238095238095,"seVolume":1},{"id":"34E49CAE-5CE3-4B58-B28D-BD4F2A213B18","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1772_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"「こいしさんが謝る必要はないですよ。\n僕とフランさんたちとの問題なので…。」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":5.0843310657596374,"title":"シーン 1772","slideTitle":"スライド #1772","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1772.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.0843310657596374,"seVolume":1},{"id":"EBC39790-8970-4DC8-8EE3-4919C50A360C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1773_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"「そう…」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":0.6806575963718821,"title":"シーン 1773","slideTitle":"スライド #1773","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1773.jpeg","voiceDuration":0.6806575963718821,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BB2BB87E-BB46-40DC-A1D4-5146FB86368C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1774_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"僕たちが、そう話していると、玄関の方から、物音がする。\nだが、すっと静かになり、僕は気にせず、ただボーっとする。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":9.014761904761905,"title":"シーン 1774","slideTitle":"スライド #1774","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1774.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.014761904761905,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/木のドアをノック1.mp3","id":"2921C15C-F767-4997-817C-C4E36F3EEC23","seStartTimeOffset":0.69,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ汗なし困り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1775_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-