p":"僕は、彼女がこいしに手を伸ばすと、押さえ込んでいたものが浮き上がり、意識が途切れると、彼女に襲いかかった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.283242630385487,"title":"シーン 1783","slideTitle":"スライド #1783","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1783.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.283242630385487,"seVolume":1},{"id":"E81D6DF1-4D43-4C93-9C36-8083BB15B0C3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/永琳.psd","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc97759_【東方アレンジ】千年幻想郷【ピアノとか笛】","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"八意永琳（主人公の担当医）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1784: 八意永琳（主人公の担当医）","slideTitle":"スライド #1784","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.25773633677991137,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc97759_【東方アレンジ】千年幻想郷【ピアノとか笛】.mp3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1784.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"83B873DB-4C4C-4DB0-ACE4-7F9A4CB700B2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/弱った寝顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1785_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこには服が敗れた状態で、寝ているさとりの姿があった。そして、部屋の隅には、泣きながら眠るこいしの姿があった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":10.28,"title":"シーン 1785","slideTitle":"スライド #1785","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1785.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.28,"seVolume":1},{"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/ドアを開ける3.mp3","id":"F7D0DF5B-DDFA-451F-9C61-A2A1F9CC840A","seStartTimeOffset":7.36,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/弱った寝顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1786_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"僕は、それを頭で理解すると同時に、とてつもない恐怖心に襲われ、そのままずるずると後ずさる。すると、部屋の扉が開く。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":9.038684807256235,"title":"シーン 1786","slideTitle":"スライド #1786","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"seName":"SE: ドアを開ける3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1786.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.038684807256235,"seVolume":0.85},{"id":"B4CF157A-97E3-4A08-9E91-E22AE77DC5D3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1787_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"僕がその扉の方に振り向くと、そこには怖い笑みを浮かべるフランとレミリアの姿があった。僕は、反射的に後ろに下がる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.294126984126985,"title":"シーン 1787","slideTitle":"スライド #1787","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1787.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.294126984126985,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6C686111-2381-4443-8705-2DB2A4900E69","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1788_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"すると、僕の足に何かが当たる。そして、僕は挟み撃ちになっていることに気がつく。だが、金縛りにあったように手足が動かせない。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":9.399546485260771,"title":"シーン 1788","slideTitle":"スライド #1788","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1788.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.399546485260771,"seVolume":1},{"id":"91B828C2-3DFB-4553-BAC8-7B38362BD868","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1789_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","telop":"そして、フランたちが今、まさに襲い掛かろうとした瞬間に、\nぷつりと何かが切れ、僕は、何かに意識を奪われた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.886507936507937,"title":"シーン 1789","slideTitle":"スライド #1789","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1789.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.886507936507937,"seVolume":1},{"id":"0CF7E7AE-EC51-483D-8544-F47C522439FD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/帽子のみ微笑.png","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc218333_【東方アレンジ】秘神マターラ【後戸真秘伝】","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"摩多羅隠岐奈（学園長）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1790: 摩多羅隠岐奈（学園長）","slideTitle":"スライド #1790","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.25411281388478585,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc218333_【東方アレンジ】秘神マターラ【後戸真秘伝】.mp3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1790.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"F89EE094-2656-4E33-A667-B5B92132BE99","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1791_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、窓からは朝日が差し込んでいた。そして、ある違和感に気がつき、ベッドを降りる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.669115646258503,"title":"シーン 1791","slideTitle":"スライド #1791","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1791.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.669115646258503,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3D6DA21E-827F-4A4A-87EC-9BECECB125AF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1792_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"すると地べたでは4人の女性が目覚めていた。「えっ？」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.4039002267573695,"title":"シーン 1792","slideTitle":"スライド #1792","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1792.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.4039002267573695,"seVolume":1},{"id":"37D76393-52FD-43F4-95BF-791357E4DEF3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1793_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"僕がそう呟くと、その4人は皆、困った表情をする。僕はそこで、昨晩の記憶を思い出そうとするが、一部分が欠けていた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":9.314761904761905,"title":"シーン 1793","slideTitle":"スライド #1793","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1793.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.314761904761905,"seVolume":1},{"id":"7516623A-69F5-43FB-8AB1-67B01FF48C2A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1794_古明地さとり.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「あの…私、昨日何してましたっけ…？」","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","duration":2.3052834467120182,"title":"シーン 1794","slideTitle":"スライド #1794","characterName":"古明地さとり","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1794.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.3052834467120182,"seVolume":1},{"id":"98CACF71-AB28-4756-A389-508C6F972659","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1795_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「私も…昨日、夕飯食べて、\nこの部屋に来たあたりから思い出せない…」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":6.3408616780045355,"title":"シーン 1795","slideTitle":"スライド #1795","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1795.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.3408616780045355,"seVolume":1},{"id":"B1BE7DDD-117C-4429-9C20-C92FEED9025A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1796_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「私は…、夕飯食べた後は、たしかお姉様と話し込んでて…」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":4.979478458049886,"title":"シーン 1796","slideTitle":"スライド #1796","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1796.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.979478458049886,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C53077FB-5A08-4484-828E-948D069AC6A9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1797_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「私は…フランと、私の部屋で、確かに、話し合っていたわ…」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":4.600498866213152,"title":"シーン 1797","slideTitle":"スライド #1797","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1797.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.600498866213152,"seVolume":1},{"id":"02F879F3-376B-474C-A3C1-353E1B12FC4D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1798_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"「とりあえず、身だしなみを整えて、朝食を食べましょうか…」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.8629931972789118,"title":"シーン 1798","slideTitle":"スライド #1798","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1798.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.8629931972789118,"seVolume":1},{"id":"87B1F44A-C540-4597-B5C2-D74BE34FD1B0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝起き顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1799_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","telop":"レミリアがそう呟くと、僕たちも賛同し、各自が諸々を済ませると、食堂に集まり、朝食の時間になるのだった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.196303854875284,"title":"シーン 1799","slideTitle":"スライド #1799","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1799.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.196303854875284,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A285FEE4-0907-4BFC-8B19-AD25B1BB20BA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/文ルイポスター寝起き.png","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc278155_【東方】歪んだ真珠のあやややや【バロック風アレンジ】","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"射命丸文（学園の国語科教師）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1800: 射命丸文（学園の国語科教師）","slideTitle":"スライド #1800","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.25662850812407684,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc278155_【東方】歪んだ真珠のあやややや【バロック風アレンジ】.mp3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1800.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"A7706078-C4C6-42DE-AD87-CC2EF55802FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1801_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","telop":"僕たちが朝食を済ますと、女性4人は、例の発表でいろいろ言いたいことを思い出したのか、4人だけで話し合いを始めた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.10390022675737,"title":"シーン 1801","slideTitle":"スライド #1801","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1801.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.10390022675737,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A2044BE7-5AAA-46E9-8734-AB7421728DA0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1802_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","telop":"僕は、暇つぶしがてら、図書館に来た。\nそして、適した本がないかどうかを探す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.00172335600907,"title":"シーン 1802","slideTitle":"スライド #1802","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1802.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.00172335600907,"seVolume":1},{"id":"EE3D6B85-72B9-4162-836E-57BC1FD22542","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1803_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","telop":"そして、ある本棚が僕を導いているように感じ、その本棚を見渡すと、魔法に関する本が、たくさん置かれていた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.864761904761905,"title":"シーン 1803","slideTitle":"スライド #1803","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1803.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.864761904761905,"seVolume":1},{"id":"46F5DD6E-AB34-4617-B3A9-938F657175AD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1804_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","telop":"そして、ある本を手に取ってみる。その本は著者の欄に、とある魔法使いと書かれていた。タイトルは魔法使い入門編だった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.654988662131519,"title":"シーン 1804","slideTitle":"スライド #1804","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1804.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.654988662131519,"seVolume":1},{"id":"66661D3D-ED6D-448E-9997-C9955197532F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1805_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","telop":"僕はその本を持ってくると、以前に使っていたスペースにある椅子に座り、その本を開く。そして、最初のページから読み始めた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.712607709750566,"title":"シーン 1805","slideTitle":"スライド #1805","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1805.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.712607709750566,"seVolume":1},{"id":"3E02DAB3-0563-4584-887B-D98A97AE7B81","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/鈴仙（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc397791_【東方】竹林鈴【狂気の瞳】","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"鈴仙・優曇華院・イナバ（学園の保健室の先生）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1806: 鈴仙・優曇華院・イナバ（学園の保健室の先生）","slideTitle":"スライド #1806","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.252243353028065,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc397791_【東方】竹林鈴【狂気の瞳】.mp3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1806.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"0A9E3ECA-80EB-4F58-98A4-0D88CA29597B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1807_博麗霊夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私が、箒で履いていると、母が私のそばに近寄ってくる。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","duration":4.966984126984127,"title":"シーン 1807","slideTitle":"スライド #1807","characterName":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1807.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.966984126984127,"seVolume":1},{"id":"A8003B50-953F-47A9-8189-85818C80464D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/靈夢（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voi