78","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1878.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.671292517006803,"seVolume":1},{"id":"F580DEFC-BAF9-4CBD-9A0F-B8318BC90521","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1879_霧雨魔理沙.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","telop":"「それで、紅夢くんは魔法について知りたいのかい？」","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","duration":3.6094784580498867,"title":"シーン 1879","slideTitle":"スライド #1879","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1879.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.6094784580498867,"seVolume":1},{"id":"C62A694C-98ED-4A7E-9CCE-4C1475C40091","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1880_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","telop":"「ええ、そうです。それで…」僕はそれから、彼女に図書館で書いてきたノートを見せながら、聞きたいことを聞いていった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.933242630385488,"title":"シーン 1880","slideTitle":"スライド #1880","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1880.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.933242630385488,"seVolume":1},{"id":"74E6EB6D-4439-4245-BD4B-343FFB825754","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/霊異変やっちまった.png","transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: nc252690_少女綺想曲_Capriccio__【東方アレンジ】","animationDuration":5,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationNote":"5秒","telop":"先代の巫女（霊夢の母親）","duration":5,"title":"シーン 1881: 先代の巫女（霊夢の母親）","slideTitle":"スライド #1881","characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.2578748153618907,"bgmAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc252690_少女綺想曲_Capriccio__【東方アレンジ】.mp3","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1881.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"id":"6FAD6DD7-B040-45EA-B178-78E8BC23BCDE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1882_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","telop":"僕は、魔理沙に聞きたいことを聞き終えると、\n今度から魔理沙に魔法の使い方を教えてもらえることになった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.589773242630385,"title":"シーン 1882","slideTitle":"スライド #1882","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編