/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"僕は、戸惑っていると、嫌な予感が走り、反射的にフランとこいしの間に座り込むと、二人の手をぎゅっと掴む。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.743038548752835,"title":"シーン 1912","slideTitle":"スライド #1912","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1912.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.743038548752835,"seVolume":1},{"id":"B265C3C8-D4AC-4B7B-8C1C-4882EB753F8E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/影ありニヤケ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1913_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"すると案の定、観覧車の扉が開き、\n明らかに様子がおかしいさとりが入ってきた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":5.643038548752834,"title":"シーン 1913","slideTitle":"スライド #1913","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1913.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.643038548752834,"seVolume":1},{"id":"19668418-FA99-47DC-A9B9-455539AA1ABD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/影ありニヤケ顔.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1914_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/