9_食堂(昼).png","telop":"「こいしさんが突然恋人の有無を聞いてきて、あの部屋がフランとの二人部屋だって言うと、ムキになって襲ってきたので…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.390861678004535,"title":"シーン 1968","slideTitle":"スライド #1968","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1968.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.390861678004535,"seVolume":1},{"id":"00FFCD3C-35E9-48F8-98BA-525DAF7CC553","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1969_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","telop":"「私が聞きたいのは紅夢の意見だよ。事実じゃない。」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","duration":4.244489795918367,"title":"シーン 1969","slideTitle":"スライド #1969","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1969.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.244489795918367,"seVolume":1},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「意見って…、僕はさっきそれを含めて話したんですが、\nもっとわかりやすく言うなら、僕はフランさんが…」","title":"シーン 1970","slideTitle":"スライド #1970","voice2StartTimeOffset":3.5571655328798184,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.7,"duration":6.40453514739229,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1970.jpeg","voice2AudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support