93,"title":"シーン 2019","slideTitle":"スライド #2019","characterName":"射命丸文","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_EF7A","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2019.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.9735827664399093,"seVolume":1},{"id":"8835BA04-0A0C-4845-8BF8-B9E35AC635CA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/文（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2020_射命丸文.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc227198_部室（昼）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc227198_部室（昼）.jpg","telop":"「ですが、あなたの行動は、こちらが予定していた試験を前取りしたのであることを私たちも認識してますから。ただし…」","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","duration":7.490181405895692,"title":"シーン 2020","slideTitle":"スライド #2020","characterName":"射命丸文","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_EF7A","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2020.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.490181405895692,"seVolume":1},{"id":"D74AA437-6E36-407E-B39E-0F22125A55A3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/文（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2021_射命丸文.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc227198_部室（昼）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc227198_部室（昼）.jpg","telop":"「あなたは、これからパチュリー博士のいる研究室に向かってもらいます。そこではアリスさんに事情を聞き取り中ですから。」"