僕がそう言った彼女と共に研究室にくると、\n彼女のいう通りアリスとパチュリーがいた。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":5.493038548752835,"title":"シーン 2023","slideTitle":"スライド #2023","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2023.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.493038548752835,"seVolume":1},{"id":"8042DF4B-59BE-449D-82BC-48FB76EE5133","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/パチュリー（弱る）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2024_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"そして、彼女はパチュリーに耳打ちしてから去って言った。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.3832426303854874,"title":"シーン 2024","slideTitle":"スライド #2024","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2024.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.3832426303854874,"seVolume":1},{"id":"71BAFADF-3194-4FB4-9BC9-F9B310210D62","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/パチュリー（微笑）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2025_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStu