…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.9865079365079366,"title":"シーン 2039","slideTitle":"スライド #2039","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2039.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.9865079365079366,"seVolume":1},{"id":"BB09E95C-ADC7-4965-B16E-720A26F9443A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc422703_血痕06【フリー素材あそび】.png","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2040_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"単色背景","telop":"僕は、そう思わず呟いていると、遠くの方から誰かが僕の声を叫んでいるような感じがして、だんだんと視界が暗転した。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.241519274376417,"title":"シーン 2040","slideTitle":"スライド #2040","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2040.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.241519274376417,"seVolume":1},{"id":"EA7F8829-9CEA-411F-9F02-CDE66444F92C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/やられ涙目驚き頬照り.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2041_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc256896_病室-昼.png","telop":"「んっ…」僕は誰かの叫び声で目が覚める。\nそこには、頬照った状態で泣いているこいしの姿があった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.074557823129251,"title":"シーン 2041","slideTitle":"スライド #2041","c