と、\n食事に出かけないとだから、彼を離してちょうだい。」","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":4.942154195011338,"title":"シーン 2133","slideTitle":"スライド #2133","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2133.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.942154195011338,"seVolume":1},{"id":"71B811C5-4F70-42DA-A3AD-1BA28C096549","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2134_古明地こいし.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","telop":"「やだ。」","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","duration":0.7331292517006802,"title":"シーン 2134","slideTitle":"スライド #2134","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2134.jpeg","voiceDuration":0.7331292517006802,"seVolume":1},{"id":"1A50FE43-8010-4F32-A85F-A609E8CD4BDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2135_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.j