魔館ロビー.jpg","telop":"「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、そこは家の玄関ホールだった。そして、ある感触がし、ふとそれを見る。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":7.348458049886621,"title":"シーン 2159","slideTitle":"スライド #2159","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2159.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.348458049886621,"seVolume":1},{"id":"844A0D9C-51EB-41EC-AF05-CFD0562AC290","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/帽子なしバトルっぽい目閉じ口閉じ.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2160_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpg","telop":"すると、こいしが僕に抱きつく形で眠っていた。そして、ふと昨晩の記憶を思い出そうとしていると、誰かの視線を感じる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":8.510430839002268,"title":"シーン 2160","slideTitle":"スライド #2160","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2160.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.510430839002268,"seVolume":1},{"id":"6DBD6553-CD71-41B8-B38E-00EF564B6697","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2161_操夢.wav","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/k